point":131,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-131","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"年暨知命，廉尚愈高，冰心與貪流爭激，霜情與晚節彌茂。","reading":"所謂知命回應五十三之歲數。","note":"所謂知命回應五十三之歲數。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":131,"end_codepoint":157,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-157","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"歷宰金山，家無寶鏤之飾；連組珠海，室靡璫珥之珍。","reading":"金山珠海宰守比喻所在資源豐厚而家無珍寶。","note":"金山珠海宰守比喻所在資源豐厚而家無珍寶。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":157,"end_codepoint":181,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-181","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"確然守志，不求聞達，實足以澄革汙吏，洗鏡貪氓。","reading":"薦稱清廉可以風化貪吏。","note":"薦稱清廉可以風化貪吏。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":181,"end_codepoint":204,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-204","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"臣謬忝司牧，任專萬里，雖情祗慎擢，才闕豪露，敢罄愚陋，舉其所知。","reading":"臣是自稱司牧的陸徽。","note":"臣是自稱司牧的陸徽。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":204,"end_codepoint":236,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-236","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"如得提名禮闈，抗迹朝省，摶嶺表之清風，負冰宇之潔望，則恩融一臣，而施光萬物。","reading":"陸徽籲予登朝，一臣為被薦的朱。","note":"陸徽籲予登朝，一臣為被薦的朱。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":236,"end_codepoint":274,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-274","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"敢緣天澤雲行，時德雨施，每甄外州，榮加遠國。","reading":"請將朝廷恩澤加諸外州。","note":"請將朝廷恩澤加諸外州。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":274,"end_codepoint":296,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-296","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"是以獻其瞽言，希垂聽覽。」","reading":"陸徽以自謙之辭作結。","note":"陸徽以自謙之辭作結。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":296,"end_codepoint":309,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:reported_age_at_recommendation1-60","kind":"reported_age_at_recommendation","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"年五十三","reading":"此為陸徽任廣州期間薦士表報齡，非卒齡。依元嘉十五年受職至二十一年受新職438至444的上下限，同用虛歲生386至392、足歲384至391。","note":"此為陸徽任廣州期間薦士表報齡，非卒齡。依元嘉十五年受職至二十一年受新職438至444的上下限，同用虛歲生386至392、足歲384至391。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":60,"end_codepoint":64,"human_reviewed":false,"reported_age":53,"possible_event_years":[438,444],"nominal_birth_years":[386,392],"completed_birth_years":[384,391],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:allusion_variant1-31","kind":"allusion_variant","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","source_quote":"衣囊揮譽於西京，折轅延高於東帝","reading":"本傳無兩姓名。校記所引《建康實錄》異文作「袁盎揮譽於西京，韓延播德於東夏」；只作異文待核。","note":"本傳無兩姓名。校記所引《建康實錄》異文作「袁盎揮譽於西京，韓延播德於東夏」；只作異文待核。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start_codepoint":31,"end_codepoint":46,"human_reviewed":false,"latter_reading_person":"韓延","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001:m0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"朱萬嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"少豫","kind":"person","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-songshu-092-zhuwansi-1-49","title":"廣州別駕從事史","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"jbp_bar_72p","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-092-zhuwansi-1-49:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","start":49,"end":56,"surface":"廣州別駕從事史","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001:m0056","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-zhuwansi-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001","quote":"上表薦士曰：「臣聞陵雪褒穎，貞柯必振；尊風賞流，清原斯挹。是以衣囊揮譽於西京，折轅延高於東帝。伏見廣州別駕從事史朱萬嗣，年五十三，字少豫，理業沖夷，秉操純白，行稱私庭，能著官政。雖氏非世祿，宦無通資，而隨牒南服，位極僚首，九綜州綱，三端府職，頻掌蕃機，屢績符守。年暨知命，廉尚愈高，冰心與貪流爭激，霜情與晚節彌茂。歷宰金山，家無寶鏤之飾；連組珠海，室靡璫珥之珍。確然守志，不求聞達，實足以澄革汙吏，洗鏡貪氓。臣謬忝司牧，任專萬里，雖情祗慎擢，才闕豪露，敢罄愚陋，舉其所知。如得提名禮闈，抗迹朝省，摶嶺表之清風，負冰宇之潔望，則恩融一臣，而施光萬物。敢緣天澤雲行，時德雨施，每甄外州，榮加遠國。是以獻其瞽言，希垂聽覽。」","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001:m0056"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"person_r